          "id": "lem-qft-qed-coherent-ir-obstruction-step-1-2",
          "claim": "By [F4]–[F6], spherical coordinates give $d^3k=r^2dr\\,d\\Omega$, so $\\|f_\\epsilon\\|^2=C_b\\int_\\epsilon^\\kappa r^{-1}dr=C_b\\log(\\kappa/\\epsilon)$, $\\langle f_\\epsilon,\\omega f_\\epsilon\\rangle=C_b(\\kappa-\\epsilon)$, and $\\|\\omega f_\\epsilon\\|^2=C_b(\\kappa^2-\\epsilon^2)/2$.",
