      ],
      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "ex-qft-qed-tree-matrix-example-step-1-1",
          "claim": "Here $h(p,p)-\\mu^2=-\\mu^2$ and $h(p+k,p+k)-\\mu^2=3\\mu^2$, so both rational inverses are defined. Since $\\Gamma(p)=0$ and $\\Gamma(k)=2\\mu\\beta$, the inverse formula in [F1] gives the displayed $S_0(p)$ and $S_0(p+k)$.",
