        {
          "id": "ex-qft-qed-tree-matrix-example-step-1-2",
          "claim": "Using $\\beta^2=I_4$ from [F2],\n$\nS_0(p+k)\\Gamma(k)S_0(p)\n=-\\frac{(2\\beta+I_4)2\\beta}{3\\mu}\n=-\\frac{4I_4+2\\beta}{3\\mu}\n=S_0(p)-S_0(p+k).\n$\nThus this off-shell rational instance satisfies the exact matrix Ward identity.",
          "step": "1.2",
          "inputs": [
            "F1",
